Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《异形魔怪：极寒之日》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,谁听说过北极有酷暑期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever heard of a heatwave in the Arctic?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.33,0:01:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到新常态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the new normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.53,0:01:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们站在北极巨型的冰冠上 这里的温度只有32华氏度（0摄氏度）{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're standing on a gigantic ice cap, and it's 32 Fahrenheit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到北极的夏天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the Arctic summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,华氏度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fahrenheit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.94,0:01:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你刚刚用的是过时的英制单位吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, did you just use that antiquated Imperial measurement?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.64,0:01:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我是那么用的 瑞典人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I did, Sweden.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 我是挪威人 不是瑞典人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm from Norway, A-hole. Not Sweden!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么区别吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there any difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.91,0:01:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你们美国人完全跟不上世界的步伐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You Americans! You're so out of step with the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个科学家 看在上帝的份上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a scientist, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,冰河学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glaciologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个基友聊天就像一对小姑娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two knob jockeys sound like a couple of Sheilas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们还是弄点岩石样本回村子吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get these core samples and get back to the outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.37,0:01:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 我们打到什么东西了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, we hit something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这些冰有年月了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is some mean ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以人们才叫它陈年冰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why they call it the Old Cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.31,0:01:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我估计需要提高了挖掘机转速{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I reckon just increase the bit speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.48,0:01:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们加把劲钻穿它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's blast right through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我探测到冰下有地震脉冲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting a seismic spike in the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 可能只是一次地壳均衡复原{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, it's probably just an isostatic rebound.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.79,0:02:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,真见鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like hell, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我的屏幕上显示强烈的地磁异常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting a big-ass magnetic anomaly on my screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是什么 它是个活物 而且个头很大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is, it's alive, and it's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.70,0:02:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,坚冰之下没有大型生命体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no big life forms that live in solid ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是反向散射触动了岩层{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe the backscatter effect brought up a rock formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 也许是只复活节兔子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and maybe it's the Easter Bunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是岩石 而且肯定不是复活节兔子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a rock, and it sure as shit isn't the Easter Bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.18,0:02:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.66,0:02:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,检查一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,澳洲人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aussie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,澳洲人 澳洲人 澳洲人 听到没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aussie? Aussie? Aussie, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么... - 拉出来 拉出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What... - Get it out! Get it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.19,0:03:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 拉出来 加油 快点快点 美国佬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get it out. Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on, Yank!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.53,0:03:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不..不..{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.47,0:03:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,美国佬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yankee!
