Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.05,0:05:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的吗 甘莫 一台运动检测器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, Gummer? A motion detector?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,完美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.53,0:05:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还有活人啊,外面都热成鬼了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man alive, it's hot as balls out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.63,0:05:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,把手放在我能看到的地方,伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands where I can see them, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哎哟 甘莫 你知道我是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, gee-whiz, Gummer! You know who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 特派员 迪克维德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me, Special Agent Dalkwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧特派员 迪克维德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it, Agent Dickweed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.25,0:05:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在恐吓联邦公职人员吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you threatening a federal officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:05:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那要看情况人 收税员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That all depends, Taxman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,棍子和石子 那是支气枪吗 甘莫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sticks and stones. Is that a pellet gun, Gummer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.19,0:06:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你打赌它就是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bet your sweet ass it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 你什么时候开始玩玩具了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, since when do you play with toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.73,0:06:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不关你的事 你带枪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since none of your damn business. You armed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,当然带枪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, I'm armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.90,0:06:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,所有美国财政部的特派员都有枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All Special Agents with the United States Treasury are armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你是知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.37,0:06:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,特派员 你很会算计啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Special Agent! You're a bean counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是持械私闯民宅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This here is private property in an open-carry state.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是碰巧对所谓的财产{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you wouldn't happen to have any financial interest
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,感兴趣吧 是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in said property, now would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 到别处收租子去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope! Go slap a lien somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.02,0:06:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,已经收过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.22,0:06:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你支持其他球对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you've changed teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.49,0:06:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不 只是帽子换了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, just hats!
