Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.93,0:06:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,坦白说 甘莫 那正是你需要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And frankly, Gummer, that's what you're gonna need,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,奇迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,因为现在 我抓住你的小辫子了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause right now, your ass is in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,说重点 迪克维德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your point, Dickweed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.31,0:07:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,国税局认为你的报税情况不实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your tax position has been deemed frivolous by the IRS
