Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,都要被拿去充公{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}deemed suitable for government auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.53,0:07:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你个狗娘养的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You parasitic son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 你的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, your...
