Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,用以消减你的罚款和利息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in your failure to file penalties and interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.71,0:07:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现你这是在幸灾乐祸 迪克维德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I detect the odorous stench of Schadenfreude, Agent Dickweed!
