Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 就像我屁股上的疖子一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, like a boil on my ass.
