Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.41,0:14:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可以诱捕三米以内的猎物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which can reach three meters to ensnare their prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你喜欢 我可以给你411{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'd like, I can give you the 411
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.45,0:14:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在形态学变异中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the morphological subspecies
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,也被称为爆尾鸟 墨西哥航空公司燃烧器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}known as the Ass Blaster a.k.a. Mexicana Combustus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你是格拉波虫科学的探索者 小组 但是我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a treasure-trove of Graboidology, Miss, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.69,0:14:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你在两个不同的大洲捕杀过它们 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've hunted and killed them on two different continents, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我坚持要致电给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I insisted that we call.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但你为何确信这次袭击是格拉波虫？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why are you so sure this is a Graboid attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,伤亡现场特征明显{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kill site has all the telltale signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.63,0:14:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,除了地理位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for location.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 应该叫直觉 第六感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Call it a gut feeling, intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要你的帮助 甘莫先生 越快越好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need your help, Mr. Gummer, and we need it ASAP!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,想想这次冒险 格拉波虫在北极地区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think of the adventure, Graboids in the Arctic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.01,0:14:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这次完全不同以往{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could be a whole new ballgame.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.71,0:14:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,球员上场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Batter up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.81,0:14:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没问她性不性感呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never asked if she was hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你去哪？ - 第二局 我来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you going? - Round two! I'm coming with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,拒绝请求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Request denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？得了吧 收起你霸道哥的嘴脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Come on, here, stop being Burt for a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,别把我排出在外了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and logic this thing out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.69,0:15:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这是收看伯特.甘莫的靶心频道的好机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our chance to revive Burt Gummer's Bull's-Eye Brand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.19,0:15:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把你从收税员手里解救出来 老兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get you free of the taxman, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 你的账本上有了很多赤字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's be honest. You've got a lot of red in your ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我的财务状况跟你没毛关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My financial status is none of your damn beeswax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你只会碍事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'll just be in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 就像我在南非那次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, like I was in South Africa? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就那一次 以后再也不会了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a one-off! Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.14,0:15:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你看问题的角度不对啊 朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking at this through the wrong end of the telescope here, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.04,0:15:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你的遗产咋办？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about your legacy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.74,0:15:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你还知道其它的格拉波虫猎人吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know of any other Graboid hunters out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:15:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 知道吗？大脚猎人...不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, you know, Bigfoot hunters... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你是伯特.甘莫 你只有一条命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Burt Gummer. You're a one-off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.45,0:16:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 伙计 教我 投资未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man, teach me! Pay it forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.56,0:16:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 我还没死呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我也没兴趣谈论你的死亡率{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, and I'm not interested in talking about your mortality, either,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.83,0:16:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但是想想吧 谁来接你的班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but think about it. Who's gonna fill your shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,当你跑不过或干不过这些怪兽时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you can no longer outrun or outgun these beasts, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我得跟你说道说道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.00,0:16:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,伯特.甘莫搞了双高跟鞋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burt Gummer's got some big-ass shoes to fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.41,0:16:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,12码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Size 12s.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我在你的衣帽间看到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen you in the locker room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的法定继承人 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're my heir apparent. Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.85,0:16:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经带我完胜格拉波虫挑战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already led me through one Graboid gauntlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.58,0:16:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还有很多不知道的东西 - 我有同感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's a lot you still don't know. - Exactly my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.18,0:16:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,学习会很有趣 我就是罗塞塔石碑 狗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Learning can be fun! Rosetta Stone me, dawg.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一本像样的搏击读本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a decent enough combat primer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.09,0:16:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 是的 我是你的幕僚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, yeah, it was! I was your wingman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,幕僚？我看更像是翼形螺帽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wingman? More like wingnut!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 那有点...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得那有点刻薄了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a little harsh, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.51,0:16:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意服从命令吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you willing to follow orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:16:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 有时候 我不...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, sometimes, I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 在战场上最重要的六英寸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, the most important six inches on the battlefield
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.35,0:17:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在你的两眼之间 明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are between your ears. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我的脸不止6英尺宽 应该是6.5{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to think I have more. I think I'm 6.5.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我耍嘴皮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't crack wise with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.22,0:17:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,明白 遵命 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.59,0:17:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 那张加拿大皇家骑警5590号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And have you filled out
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.79,0:17:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,非居民携枪豁免权的申请表 你填完了没？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the requisite non-resident special exemption RCMP-5590 form?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,长官...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说啥？ - 那张加拿大皇家骑警5590号申请表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - The RCMP-5590 form!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你要想带着枪进加拿大 就得填那表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For that firearm you're planning on bringing into Canada.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.01,0:17:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.08,0:17:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那你最好下一份 快填{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then you better download one and fill it out pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,拿你的北极装备去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab your arctic gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.02,0:17:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,YES{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到加拿大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the Great White North, eh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.24,0:18:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说不毛之地吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise known as Nowheresville.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,从这往南1000英里才是呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're about 1,000 miles north of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在是在..呃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're somewhere between, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.12,0:18:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,既没多少人来过也没多少人想来的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't-Never-Been and Don't-Wanna-Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,冰川都去哪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are all the glaciers?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,化了 雪橇的失业率已经创历史新高了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Melting. Sled dog unemployment's at an all-time high.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还要多长时间才到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much longer till we're there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.30,0:18:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,用不了多久了 前面拐外弯就到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not far. Just around the bend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你的GPS导航呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your GPS?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.14,0:18:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在是在北极圈内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in the Arctic Circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.67,0:18:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,GPS定位也起不了多大作用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satellites up here are more miss than hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不过别担心 路线图都在我脑子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't worry. It's all up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是最靠谱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.15,0:18:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,后面什么情况 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is it back there, Mr. Gummer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.25,0:18:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我的地震监测仪完全派不上用场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My seismic vibration monitor is completely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然 到科研站后 你就可以联网了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, you can log in to the inter-Web when we get you on station.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 话说我可是你节目的忠实粉丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Peachy. - Hey, I'm a big fan of your series.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:19:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我特别喜欢把肉干和昆虫当做蛋白质来源的那集{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I loved that episode on dried meats and insects as proteins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是要把家酿酒偷运出去啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you're smuggling home-brew grain alcohol into dry territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.07,0:19:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 当地部落当局面非常正派{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the local tribal authority are a bit blue-nosed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.18,0:19:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能悄悄的偷运点酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I'm forced to bring it in under the radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.35,0:19:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,沉默是金 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ask, don't tell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.75,0:19:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,YES{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,特拉维斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travis!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不可能吧 - 真的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It can't be. - It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的什么？ - 一次空袭将要发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It is what? - We got a hostile aerial incursion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.07,0:19:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在海拔多高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your altitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,1400英尺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1,400 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我建议你躲避 降落飞机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you take evasive action and put this plane on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.47,0:19:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,北极竟有爆尾鸟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ass Blasters in the Arctic?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,它们在瞄准你的飞机引擎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're keying in on your engine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 它们对热源很敏感 - 它们是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, they're heat seekers. - Who's they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.29,0:19:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,爆尾鸟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ass Blasters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.83,0:20:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 机鸟互撞 - 我们的引擎熄火了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bird strike. - We've lost the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧 天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No shit, Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.50,0:20:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快迫降 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get this down! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,做好冲撞准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by for some chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.17,0:20:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要坠机了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that mean crash?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.94,0:20:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,跟人类斗 万有引力从不失手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gravity never loses!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们顶多打个平手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best we can hope for is a draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.65,0:20:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 迎接大冲撞吧 - 什么冲撞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brace for impact! - Impact? What impact?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.37,0:20:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.67,0:20:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 我们得赶紧出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa. We're so out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哎哟 不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.53,0:21:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,黑衣人来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here they come, the men in black.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.95,0:21:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀呀 看看谁来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well! What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是《猫和老鼠》里的汤姆和杰瑞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tom and Jerry?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.55,0:21:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,还有《冰上大歌舞》的弗里克跟弗兰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frick and Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.39,0:21:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 不对 更像是《虎豹小霸王》里的布奇和圣丹斯小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, more like Butch and Sundance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.49,0:21:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,还有《警界双雄》里的斯塔斯基和哈金森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starsky and Hutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.12,0:21:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像闻到酒味了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I smell alcohol?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我的飞机用的时候生物燃料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My bird runs on bio-fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可你们却没少往我们第一民族的地盘上运私酒吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're bootlegging moonshine into a First Nations territory?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.77,0:21:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是一大禁忌啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a big time no-no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.50,0:21:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就不客气了 别介意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't mind if we help ourselves now, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,钱还是要给的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's a matter of payment, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.51,0:21:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,都算在我头了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it on my tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.51,0:21:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,请问你大名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这儿忙着追杀怪虫的这段时间里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your next-door neighbor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.62,0:22:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是你对门邻居了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while you're up here on your little worm hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们没心思招待客人 所以你们要小心点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's no welcome mat on my doorstep, so tread lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.53,0:22:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,给你个建议 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A piece of advice, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要不妨碍我做事 老实交税{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay out of my way and pay your taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.33,0:22:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我丑话说在前头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider yourself properly warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.17,0:22:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.67,0:22:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪知道 你说呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.68,0:22:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,既然我们是邻居 那我也给你点建议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since we're neighbors, here's some neighborly advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,在我解决掉这儿的怪虫问题之前 把你的人撤走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beat a retreat until I get this area cleared out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.68,0:22:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,走？没门 我们才刚安顿下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retreat? Hell, no. We're just getting started up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.15,0:22:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那就另找个地儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then find a safe place to hunker down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.42,0:22:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我丑话也说到前头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider yourself properly warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.43,0:22:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识这个家伙吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that skid mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.10,0:22:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你都知道些什么关于他的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can you tell me about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.70,0:22:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,据说他是来这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, rumor has it he's up here working
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.67,0:23:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,搞一些51区之类的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on some Area 51 stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.31,0:23:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,美国高级什么局...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some joint US-Canadian turd factory
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.44,0:23:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,建一个美加合资的破工厂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}being developed by Harpo... Darpo...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.35,0:23:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,美国国防部高级研究计划局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean DARPA?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.75,0:23:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,正是 你知道他们？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the one! Know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.72,0:23:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 他们就是邪恶的代名词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they're the acronym for evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.47,0:23:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是瓦莱利？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be Valerie?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.07,0:23:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,正是 乐意为您效劳 谢谢您回应了我们的求救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At your service. And thanks for answering our SOS.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.90,0:23:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我的无线电台还在用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, my call sign, these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.17,0:23:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是俄克拉克 他是本地人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Aklark. He's our resident local boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.87,0:23:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 马克 今天可真是不顺 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mac. I saw you came in a bit hectic there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.88,0:23:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 有点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.21,0:23:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这是刚从狂欢节回来么？还是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you guys just come from Burning Man, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.68,0:23:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉如何？伯特先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's it, Mr. Burt?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.85,0:23:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 加拿大的人都认识你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! They even know you in Canada!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.49,0:23:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你没跟我提爆尾鸟的事啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You failed to tell me about the AB infestation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.26,0:23:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们这儿有爆尾鸟？ - 对啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have Ass Blasters? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.33,0:23:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不太正常啊 小姑娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't a polar bear, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.03,0:23:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,爹妈一定不相信的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom and Dad aren't gonna believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.86,0:24:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,爹妈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Mom and Dad"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候叙旧了 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's a blast from the past, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.67,0:24:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我是瓦尔和朗达的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Val and Rhonda's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.57,0:24:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧 格拉波虫天启觉醒事件里的瓦尔和朗达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Val and Rhonda from the OG Graboid apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.14,0:24:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不要思议吧 你就是特拉维斯吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crazy, huh? You must be Travis.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.41,0:24:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.58,0:24:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...这些年来我都没怎么跟你父母联系过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... I kind of lost track of your parents over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.61,0:24:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 联系不到他们 尤其是瓦尔 很正常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. They're easy to lose track of, especially Val.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.45,0:24:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去科研站吧 大家都在等你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get you back to the station. Everybody's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.09,0:24:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他本身就不愿跟人保持联系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not the keeping-in-touch type.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.96,0:24:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.44,0:24:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.85,0:25:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你这次来是全副武装啊 伯特先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you've come up north loaded for bear, Mr. Burt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.52,0:25:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你这是拍明翰武器公司303式自动步枪吧 真不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, BSA .303. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.49,0:25:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,要对付绝大多数恶棍还是可以的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll kill most varmints.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.99,0:25:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 不过要是拿这枪对付格拉波虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, for the varmints we're hunting,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.32,0:25:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就像弹弓对付坦克一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's like shooting a slingshot at a Sherman tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.63,0:25:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为这儿会有多冷呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it'd be colder than a reindeer's ball bag up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.60,0:25:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正处在一股北极热浪的中心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in the middle of an Arctic heat wave,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.86,0:25:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,冰雪都在加速融化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which has greatly accelerated the snow melt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.03,0:25:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 这儿可真暖和{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, I'm hotter than a 50 cal on full auto!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.90,0:25:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,甘莫先生 很高兴您能来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gummer, glad you could make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.47,0:25:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎您来到博伊特谷北极科研站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the Bo顃e Canyon Arctic Research Station
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.01,0:25:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,您也可以像我们一样 叫它世界尽头科研站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or, like we used to call it, science at the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.04,0:25:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,您是丽塔.西姆斯博士吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be, uh, Dr. Rita Sims?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.68,0:25:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到您 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good to meet you. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.91,0:25:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是弗里兹博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Dr. Ferezze.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.25,0:26:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是查尔斯.弗里兹 - 博士 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Charles Ferezze. - Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.62,0:26:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,您旅途如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was your flight in?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.82,0:26:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 一点小麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's just say, uh, we hit some chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.66,0:26:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的引擎坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We blew the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.69,0:26:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上 我们受到爆尾鸟袭击了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, we came under Ass Blaster attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.80,0:26:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在躲避中 飞机引擎烧毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and during the ensuing aerial dogfight, the engine was blown.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.23,0:26:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爆尾鸟？ - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- An Ass Blaster? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.57,0:26:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,引擎烧毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blew the engine?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.27,0:26:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你还得用飞机送我们回去呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you have to fly me back to Montreal so I can report
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.94,0:26:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,向上级汇报最新情况呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the powers that be about the recent turn of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.58,0:26:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那只能等我把它修好后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they'll just have to wait till I get this puppy airborne again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.08,0:26:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可我等不及了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't stay here one more minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.12,0:26:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,报歉 我去修引擎了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. I've got an engine to fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.22,0:26:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.69,0:26:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,弗里兹博士总是一惊一乍的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Ferezze, he startles at the drop of a feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.09,0:26:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉我们还没互相介绍过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. We haven't met yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.53,0:26:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 他是特拉维斯.韦尔克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Travis Welker, my, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.86,0:26:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我的...助手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wing, uh... Wingman.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.67,0:26:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢您前来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.70,0:26:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我得进去查下情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to go inside, get the lay of the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.27,0:26:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,日落竟然是在凌晨3点48分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sunset at 3:48 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.24,0:27:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对呀 这儿可是午夜阳光的国度 韦尔克先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's the Land of the Midnight Sun, Mr. Welker.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.28,0:27:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说太阳不会完全落山（跟我口交）{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you saying that the sun is never going down on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.32,0:27:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对 太阳不会落到地平线以下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's never gonna go below the horizon,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.49,0:27:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你是这个意思的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if that's what you're asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.62,0:27:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们派了一支三人钻探队到那边山上的冰盖上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We sent a three-man drill team to the glacial field
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.32,0:27:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,离这儿大约有半天的路程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about a half a day up mountain from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.56,0:27:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,三人全KIA{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have three KIA?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.63,0:27:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,就是阵亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killed in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.86,0:27:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 这缩写哪能随便用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, that's a big 10-4, good buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.77,0:27:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是斯瓦克哈莫 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Name's Swackhamer. - Swackhamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.93,0:27:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方就是我亲手建的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hammered-and-nailed this place together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.50,0:27:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你要有什么事找我就行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to know anything, I'm your guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.34,0:27:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,三人中两人确认死亡 另一人推断死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's two that we can verify dead, one assumed dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.28,0:27:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,已确认？怎么确认的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Verified? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.98,0:27:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,根据现场情况判断的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, from the kill site.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.28,0:27:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,丽塔和她的队友找到了一个头颅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rita and her crew managed to recover a severed head,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.95,0:27:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一个被吃得只剩下一部分骨盆 还有一个吃了一半的睾丸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a partially eaten pelvis, and a half-eaten testicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.35,0:27:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是怎么找到那个吃了一半的睾丸的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you recover a half-eaten testicle?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.79,0:27:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那 这儿的雪怎么都不见了？西姆斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, where's all the snow, Dr. Sims?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.96,0:27:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,今年是北极地区有记录以来最温暖的一年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This year in particular has been one of the warmest on record up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.49,0:27:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是哈特.汉森先生 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet Hart Hansen, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.30,0:27:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,地貌学博士 毕业于剑桥大学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a PhD in Geomorphology from the University of Cambridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.53,0:27:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 对 玩飞机的那位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, yeah, airplane boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.77,0:28:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是遥控机 算是个爱好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an RC. Kind of a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.61,0:28:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...的确是个爱好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's actually a habit, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.74,0:28:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我上瘾了 总之{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, it's an addiction. Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.01,0:28:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴认识您 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a pleasure to meet you, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.48,0:28:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,相信您会发现从地质学角度来讲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you'll find that Bo顃e Canyon
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.98,0:28:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,博伊特谷是个独特的存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a very unique geological phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.32,0:28:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿的永久性冰冻苔原{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This perennially frozen tundra is interrupted
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.69,0:28:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,被近10平方公里的融土地带分割开来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for approximately 10 square kilometers by thawed soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.32,0:28:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,融土？外边是非常干燥的啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thawed? It's bone dry out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.82,0:28:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的融水温泉是地热能的典型体现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Meltwater Hot Springs are a pleasant symptom
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.86,0:28:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,而地热则从地球内部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of geothermal heat, which warms the Earth from deep beneath the land
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.40,0:28:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不断对我们脚下的土地加热{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we're standing on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.63,0:28:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这样一来 爆尾鸟的存在就很合理了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That explains the ABs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.00,0:28:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,爆尾鸟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ass Blasters!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.53,0:28:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爆尾鸟... - 你们以为很可笑吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ass Blasters... - You think this is funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.47,0:28:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这些生物绝不能小看 它们就是杀人不眨眼的冷血机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These creatures are no joke. They are all-go, no-quit killing machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.21,0:28:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉你们失去了三位朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I'm sorry for the loss of your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.95,0:28:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你们不照我说的做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if you don't do exactly as I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.38,0:28:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,伤亡一定会复现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they won't be the last to die around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.55,0:28:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这不好笑 我们懂了 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not funny, Mr. Gummer. We get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.25,0:28:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,离海拔永久冻土正在融化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The permafrost at a higher elevation is melting,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.89,0:28:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,使得苔原生态系统更加脆弱 格拉波虫也就趁虚而入了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so the tundra is more easily breached. Ergo, Graboids.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.56,0:29:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说造成这次格拉波虫灾的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're telling me melting ice caps and warmer temperatures
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.87,0:29:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是冰盖的融化和升高的温度？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are causing this, uh, Graboid Arctic stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.20,0:29:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多吧 但还有别的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of, but there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.70,0:29:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那我给你讲讲吧 到底为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enlighten me. Why here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.44,0:29:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因为进化 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evolution, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.51,0:29:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,大自然教会我们一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one thing Nature has taught us,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.91,0:29:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是生物有能力拓展新领地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's life can expand into new territories.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.75,0:29:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,或许这次的格拉波虫就是最原始的一批{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe these are the first Graboids.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.62,0:29:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 就像是前前寒武纪 - 正是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, like pre-Precambrian. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.25,0:29:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,或许它们在几十亿年前 就向南迁移了数百万英里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And maybe they migrated south millions, maybe even billions of years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.89,0:29:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,并进化为沙漠生物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and evolved into a desert creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.62,0:29:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如今 数十亿的冰冻沉眠后...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, after countless giga-annum lying dormant in ice...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.69,0:29:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,它们醒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.10,0:29:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧 这也太玄乎了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, this sounds like a bunch of sassafras!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.27,0:29:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,的确是这样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It does sound sassafrassy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.40,0:29:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,西姆斯博士 能跟你私下说几句吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Sims, a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.41,0:29:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还要多久才能修好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.91,0:29:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我得把进气歧管缝合好 修复汽化器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to cold-stitch the intake manifold, rebuild the carb.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.78,0:29:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 如果你不赶紧把这些破玩意修好 我就...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if you don't get this clunker in the air soon, I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.02,0:29:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你就怎样？佛粒子博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll what, Mr. Freeze?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.19,0:30:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是弗里兹 查尔斯.弗里兹博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ferezze. Dr. Charles Ferezze.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.37,0:30:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.77,0:30:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,美国国防部高级研究计划局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DARPA.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.48,0:30:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在这里干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.85,0:30:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 他们么？！ - 嘘 小声点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, them? - Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.09,0:30:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就是他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.52,0:30:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟他们什么关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your association with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.79,0:30:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是我们邻居啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're our research neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.70,0:30:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们干嘛要小声说话 他们又听不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are we whispering? They can't hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.30,0:30:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们什么时候来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did they arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.60,0:30:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,几个月前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They arrived a couple of months ago.
