Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.87,0:39:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了 伯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on with you, Burt?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.97,0:39:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在球场上摔跤一点也像你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like you to take a knee on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.44,0:39:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.85,0:39:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪买到的HK91步枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd you get that HK91?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.12,0:40:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰一下 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gummer?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.02,0:40:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要看一些东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something that you need to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.20,0:40:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,和上次测量相比 水位下降了15cm{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The water levels dropped 15 centimeters since our last measurement.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.33,0:40:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,在样品的土壤气体中发现了一种新的化学元素{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The samples have detected a new chemical element in the soil gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.97,0:40:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,能确定它是什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you determine what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.91,0:40:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯..计算机把它读成HCO2H{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... The computer's reading it as HCO2H.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.35,0:40:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,甲酸？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Formic acid?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.05,0:40:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.35,0:41:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,而且是高浓缩的剂量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and it's a highly concentrated dose.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.92,0:41:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,PH值的酸度已经下降了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The acidity in the pH is off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.90,0:41:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.27,0:41:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.63,0:41:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 现在就出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out! Get out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.21,0:42:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.02,0:42:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.79,0:42:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经被感染了 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been infected, Mr. Gummer,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.46,0:42:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,被一种寄生生物感染{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by what appears to be a parasitic organism that is
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.09,0:42:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,它的破坏性强而且潜伏期长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}quite hostile and has an extremely slow gestation.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.80,0:42:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,坏消息是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the bad news?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.03,0:43:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,非常不幸 它在某一成熟阶段会分泌一种神经毒素{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, unfortunately, it secretes a neurotoxin at a certain maturation,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.74,0:43:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,杀死宿主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}killing the host.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.11,0:43:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,杀死宿主？你是说伯特是宿主吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killing the host? You mean, Burt being the host?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.65,0:43:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经鉴定出这种毒素来自于格拉波虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've identified the toxin as originating from a Graboid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.82,0:43:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,格拉波虫吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Graboid?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.09,0:43:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 见鬼.. - 听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What... - Just indulge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.26,0:43:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,脑炎引起的眼睛出血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood behind the eye caused by cerebral inflammation.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.86,0:43:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,晚期 情况很糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Advanced stage. It's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.70,0:43:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要抗体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna need antibodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.87,0:43:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么得到它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, how do we get them?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.14,0:43:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,从格拉波虫那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From a Graboid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.27,0:43:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们可以在血库停下去抓一只{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we can get one to stop by the blood bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.41,0:43:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是怎么被格拉波虫病毒感染的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did you get infected by a Graboid?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.09,0:43:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,被它吞进肚子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in the belly of the beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.10,0:44:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我们杀了一只格拉波虫 搞定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so we kill a Graboid. We get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.87,0:44:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我来吧 伯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this, Burt.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.03,0:44:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这些抗体需要从活的格拉波虫中提取出来才能存活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The antibodies need to be extracted from a live Graboid to be viable.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.97,0:44:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,活的格拉波虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A live Graboid?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.94,0:44:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.28,0:44:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算用套索套住它的脖子吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You plan on throwing a lasso over its neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.15,0:44:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我需要做一个周界扫描{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'll excuse me, I need to do a perimeter sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.72,0:44:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你还不明白你的状况有多紧急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you understand the urgency of your condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.59,0:44:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不要让我的情况妨碍到重要的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let the urgent get in the way of the important.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.29,0:44:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,您的身体在衰竭 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your body is failing, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.76,0:44:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,胡扯 我想做二次诊断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit! I want a second opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.60,0:44:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 所有一切都显示你有男子气概{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know that's all macho and everything, Burt,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.47,0:44:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但我更关心你的健康{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I happen to care about your health!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.27,0:44:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,关心别的地方吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go care someplace else.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.90,0:44:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么胡话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a dick thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.01,0:44:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没有病毒能逍遥法外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No bad seed shall go unpunished!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.79,0:44:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,把它从我身上拿开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.33,0:45:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.56,0:45:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要松手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.53,0:45:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抓紧 - 请不要松手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold on! - Don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.10,0:45:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天哪 - 求你了 别松手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My God! - Please, don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.50,0:45:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 求你了 别松手 - 我抓住你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please, don't let go. - I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.14,0:45:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抓紧我 抓紧我 - 该死 我抓住你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold me! Hold me! - Shit! I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.67,0:45:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.79,0:45:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 封锁窗口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Block that window!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.55,0:45:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 各位 都系好颌带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, everyone, buckle your chinstraps
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.96,0:45:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,然后打包一块肉三明治 我们受到了攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and pack a meat sandwich! We are under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.59,0:45:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,关严所有车门和车窗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secure all doors and windows!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.90,0:45:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,天 真棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this is just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.97,0:45:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被一种凶猛的地下生物攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're under attack by a hostile underground life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.00,0:45:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.70,0:45:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.34,0:45:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,取出几汤匙水泥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a couple of tablespoons of cement
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.04,0:45:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,把它硬化 嗯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and harden the hell up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.51,0:45:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 听着 有武器的人把它装上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, look, anybody with a weapon, load it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.68,0:46:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的棍子很得力 无论什么时候都能用到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have the sharp end of the stick. Whatever you got, use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.52,0:46:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,牛仔女孩 放松点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, there, cowgirl!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.52,0:46:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我没法让地震监视器运行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get this seismic vibration monitor working.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.82,0:46:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的数据链和网络摄像头都坏了 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our data-link and NetCam are down, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.79,0:46:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚那只爆尾鸟把我们的通讯塔拆掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, the Ass Blaster tore our comms tower apart last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.99,0:46:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你能修好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.10,0:46:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,斯瓦克哈莫整个上午都在研究这个问题 但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swackhamer's been working on it all morning, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.33,0:46:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,高频天线完全损坏了 同轴电缆被切断了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The HF antenna's totally destroyed. Coax has been severed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.80,0:46:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,网格盒也被击中了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The grid pack dish is totally shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.17,0:46:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 多久能修好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, how long will it take to fix?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.94,0:46:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 至少一天 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A day, at least. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.27,0:46:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,铱星卫星电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iridium satellite phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.71,0:46:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁拿走了卫星电话 - 我之前见弗里兹博士拿过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who took the sat phone? - I saw Dr. Ferezze with it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.91,0:46:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 费雷泽逃走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Ferezze flew the coop.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.02,0:46:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,找到他 尽快给我打电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, find him and get that sat phone to me ASAP!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.95,0:46:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们唯一的救命稻草 我们必须打电话给疏散中心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our lifeline out of here. We've got to call in Evac
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.65,0:46:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,让这些孩子到安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get these kids someplace safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.42,0:46:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我可在800码处投弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can drop an elk at 800 yards
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.22,0:46:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,并在30分钟内把怪物处理好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and field dress it in less than 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.03,0:46:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这样你就不用担心了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that'll pull you out of your worry well.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.59,0:46:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们准备好了 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're up for this, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.26,0:46:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 麦基小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that, Miss McKee.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.40,0:46:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,试着做吧 目标是格拉波虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are flying blind. Advantage, Graboid.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.50,0:46:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,西姆斯博士 我从来没有正确地了解过这片土地的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was never properly briefed on the lay of the land, Dr. Sims.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.24,0:46:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这个位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.61,0:47:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的四周都是高山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are mountains to our east, west, north, and south.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.14,0:47:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个真正的地道峡谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a true box canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.41,0:47:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,完全的地理隔离 太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Total geographic isolation. D閖?freaking-vu!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.22,0:47:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是工棚 这是美国国防部高级研究计划局的营地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the bunkhouses. That's DARPA encampment.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.12,0:47:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机库在我们前方大约120m{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hangar's about 120 meters to our direct front.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.06,0:47:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,阿弗拉克在它下方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aflac's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.52,0:47:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是阿克拉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Aklark!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.79,0:47:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,做点有用的事 温曼 向飞机库呼救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make yourself useful, Wingman. Give the hangar a holler.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.93,0:47:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,用什么 杯子和绳子吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With what, a cup and a string?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.60,0:47:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,用对讲机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use the walkie-talkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.67,0:47:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 北极星一号 这里是北极星基地 收到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, North Star One, this is North Star Base. You copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.54,0:47:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,收到了老兄 北极星一号 回复你的方位 结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got Mac, North Star One. Send your traffic. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.64,0:47:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 把它关掉 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, shut it down now, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.68,0:47:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,停止所有工作并呆在里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop all work and stay inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.98,0:47:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？ - 一条路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's this? - A road.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.42,0:47:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说这条崎岖不平的路？已经走不了了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean washboard. The road's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.79,0:47:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,去年冬天塌方 完全走不了了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Landslide last winter. It's totally impassable.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.46,0:47:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,整个基地就像是格拉波虫的开阔野原{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole base is like open range for a Graboid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.36,0:47:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 你现在告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second. You're telling me
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.16,0:47:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在死亡地带中间没有出路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're smack dab in the middle of a kill zone and no way out?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.34,0:48:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,大家不要动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.99,0:48:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Valerie.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.57,0:48:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我想它要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.41,0:48:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.14,0:48:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,它被另一种震动吸引了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's caught wind of another vibration.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.55,0:48:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,有东西在动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.62,0:48:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.16,0:48:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我在工棚里没找到弗里兹博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't find Dr. Ferezze in the bunkhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.66,0:48:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那个擅离职守的混蛋又去哪了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That cheese-dick gone AWOL again?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.76,0:49:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,oh{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.04,0:49:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.08,0:49:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,弗里兹博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Ferezze!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.38,0:49:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哈特 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hart, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.45,0:49:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,回来 别傻傻地跟着傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back here! Don't follow stupid with stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.83,0:49:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,弗里兹博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Ferezze!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.06,0:49:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,回来弗里兹博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back, Dr. Ferezze!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.01,0:49:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,弗里兹博士 你要去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Ferezze, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.71,0:49:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,除了这里 哪都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anywhere but here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.18,0:49:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点 想想 弗里兹博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just calm down and think, Dr. Ferezze.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.15,0:49:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,除了这 你别无他处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nowhere for you to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.08,0:49:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我要碰碰运气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.55,0:49:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈特 - 它来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hart! - Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.72,0:50:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,弗里兹博士 拜托 别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Ferezze! Please, don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.39,0:50:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,别发动汽车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't start the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.96,0:50:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 走了 朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please! - Hasta luego, amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.26,0:50:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,弗里兹博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Ferezze!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.33,0:50:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 我子弹空了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, I don't have a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.14,0:50:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,弗里兹博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Ferezze!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.98,0:50:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,进去 所有人 马上 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside! Everyone, now! Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.32,0:51:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的东西是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This shit just got real!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.19,0:51:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢想象那个怪物会对弗里兹博士做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe what that thing did to Dr. Ferezze.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.69,0:51:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这些怪物刚从冬眠中醒来 根据它们瓣身体质量指数{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just came out of hibernation and, based on their body mass index,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.36,0:51:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,它们需要吃很多东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}those creatures need to eat a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.10,0:51:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有多少 - 很难说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many are there? - It's impossible to tell...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.03,0:51:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没有地震监测仪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without my seismic vibration monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.47,0:51:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能呆在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.33,0:51:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,明白 我们的武器还不够对付这些怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that. We've got weapons, but not enough for these bad boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.17,0:51:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那就见招拆招吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bigger the problem, the bigger the hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.94,0:51:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？你有什么想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? What've you got in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.21,0:51:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机库中有一些炸药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a couple of cases of dynamite in the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.28,0:51:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,还有汽油 工具和其他零碎的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Petrol, tools, bear bangers, odds and ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.88,0:51:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有足够的东西可以引爆炸药 我们可以把炸弹塞进它们的喉咙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's enough stuff to MacGyver a bomb we can stuff down their throats!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.48,0:51:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,它们吃了会怎样不关我们的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like that's our FOB.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.25,0:51:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.72,0:51:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机库的地板被压实了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hangar's got a compacted chip-stone floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.29,0:51:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 伙计 他们会上钩的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on, man. They're gonna be like
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.06,0:51:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,像鲨鱼咬住苹果一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sand sharks bobbing for apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.69,0:51:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 然后我们就成了被咬的红富士牌苹果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and we'll be the Granny Smiths.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.59,0:51:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,地板有1.2m厚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This floor is 1.2 meters above the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.93,0:51:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,由钢铁结构支撑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}supported by a steel substructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.70,0:51:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那些东西无法击倒这个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those things won't be able to knock this place down.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.23,0:51:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这只是时间问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but it's only a matter of time
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.74,0:51:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,只是在他们冲过地板并且吃掉我们的午餐之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before they come blasting through the floor and eat our lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.74,0:51:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个主意 发电机在机库对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got an idea. The generator's in the hangar, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.47,0:52:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 三相电源 63-amp电缆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Triple-phase power, 63-amp cables.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.78,0:52:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,根据这些图纸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to these blueprints,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.38,0:52:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这个机库有一个深桩基础{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this hangar's got a deep-pile foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.41,0:52:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 钢铁沉箱直接进入基岩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, steel caissons going directly into the bedrock.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.05,0:52:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己钻的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drilled it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.12,0:52:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为你可以重铺设电力 这样它就能进入钢铁沉箱吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you can re-route the power so it goes to the steel caissons?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.72,0:52:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的是我想的这样吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you saying what I'm thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.39,0:52:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你想的是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you thinking I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.79,0:52:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我想的是我们注入电流{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinking that you're saying that we shoot a dose of milliamps
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.16,0:52:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,直接进入地下水并创造某种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}straight into the groundwater and create some kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.10,0:52:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 地下电栅栏？- 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Underground electrical fence. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.17,0:52:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这正是我说的而也是你在想的 你能做到吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly what I'm saying you're thinking. Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.17,0:52:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是事半功倍的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've done more with less.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.47,0:52:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 但如果不奏效 我们就死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but if it doesn't work, we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.91,0:52:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那到底是什么 伯特 你有把果冻钉在墙上过吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what the hell, Burt? Have you ever nailed Jell-O to a wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.81,0:52:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道这有什么关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure how that's relevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.14,0:52:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这很重要 因为我做到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's relevant because I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.61,0:52:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着 它卡住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And guess what? It stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.82,0:52:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道为什么吗？因为每个人都说我不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why? Because everyone said I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.12,0:52:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我明白了 我知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I got it. I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.89,0:52:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一个计划 我们去机库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we've got a plan. We're off to the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.09,0:52:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,分成两队 特拉维斯 你和西姆斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teams of two. Travis, you, and Dr. Sims.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.59,0:52:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,斯瓦克哈莫 你和我一队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swackhamer, you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.20,0:52:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,温曼 我们需要转移视线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wingman, we're gonna need a diversion!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.07,0:52:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.90,0:52:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我要假装我没听到你把我漏掉了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna pretend I didn't just hear you leave me out
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.90,0:53:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我努力的加入这次蠕虫狩猎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I'm coming on this worm hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.81,0:53:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,厄尔猎人 是吗？你会用这个小短腿吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elk hunter, huh? Think you can bang on this short arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.38,0:53:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,小意思 你想要让它可控还是想让它变成一个危险的游戏？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piece of cake. You zero that scope for distance or dangerous game?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.15,0:53:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你认为呢？ - 这是个垃圾问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you think? - Stupid question.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.32,0:53:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,介意我调整成我喜欢的模式吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind if I tweak it for my preferred point of impact?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.19,0:53:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸和我总是把我们的望远镜瞄准在100码高2.5英寸的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad and I always zeroed our scopes at 2.5 inches high at 100 yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.12,0:53:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可以 随便{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, whatever floats your boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.83,0:53:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你来看守 带上瓦加斯 到屋顶上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're on overwatch. Take Vargas and go on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.36,0:53:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.53,0:53:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了吗？它要踢你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And hold on tight, huh? She'll kick some!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.30,0:53:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.50,0:53:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要枪还是瓦斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gun or Vargas?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.67,0:53:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,老头子 感觉如何？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You feel up for this, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.21,0:53:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,还行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.84,0:53:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.55,0:53:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 你准备好了吗？西姆斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you ready, Dr. Sims?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.81,0:53:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,靠 看谁来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit. Look what the cat dragged in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.89,0:53:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 真棒 你在这里 - 卡茨先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, good. You're here. - Mr. Cutts.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.25,0:53:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚在融水温泉失去了我的顶尖科学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just lost my top scientist at the Meltwater Hot Springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.42,0:53:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有他你就力不从心了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just got in over your head and had to punt, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.59,0:53:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你的实验简直是胡作非为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your experiment's run amok.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.00,0:54:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我的实验？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My experiment?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.26,0:54:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？你觉得是我在控制这些…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you think I'm actually controlling these...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.53,0:54:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊当然是你在控制 你的心理测试告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but of course you would. Your psych eval suggested as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.37,0:54:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你有我的档案吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had me profiled?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.81,0:54:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉让你失望了 但这不是莫罗博士的岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to disappoint you, but this is not the Island of Dr. Moreau.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.71,0:54:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是那种道德败类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not some kind of walking ethical dumpster fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.85,0:54:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里的使命比这更崇高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mission here is more elevated than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.08,0:54:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是啊 没有美国国防部高级研究计划局的讨厌鬼在这里工作 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. No DARPA skunk works in the hopper, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.62,0:54:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是没有生物工程 或是一小段格拉波虫的转基因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No bio-engineering perhaps? A little Graboid gene-splicing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.99,0:54:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 这是个好主意 但我不想要生物武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, that's a good idea, but bio-weapons are not my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.70,0:54:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我和一个工程团队在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here with an engineering team
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.40,0:54:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,评估地下水的纯度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to assess the purity of the groundwater
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.43,0:54:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,设计一个地下蓄水层 将水从北极运到文明世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to design an aquifer to move it out of the Arctic and into civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.10,0:54:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是关于水的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is about water?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.74,0:54:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,水是新的能源 你可能已经注意到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Water is the new oil, and, as you may have noticed,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.81,0:54:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,北极现在有丰富的资源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Arctic has it in abundance now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.18,0:54:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只出现了其中一种生物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It took just one of those creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.04,0:54:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不到一分钟就杀了我最好的科学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}less than a minute to kill my best scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.11,0:54:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,都别动！都别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody move! Nobody move.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.79,0:54:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,它在地板下面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's under the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.92,0:55:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.09,0:55:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.06,0:55:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,让我下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me unload.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.83,0:55:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.80,0:55:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,开火！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire at will!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.77,0:55:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,耶！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.47,0:55:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,救我！救我！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.87,0:55:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,救我！救我！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.14,0:55:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,救我！救我！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.82,0:56:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我们快走 开枪！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Let's scoot and shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.28,0:56:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.13,0:56:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,北星一号到北星机库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}North Star One to North Star Hangar.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.10,0:56:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在向你走来 结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are coming your way. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.13,0:56:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,明白 甘莫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that, Mr. Gummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.44,0:56:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来好像是你踩在上面了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like you stepped in it up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.47,0:56:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定的 是时候深入了解一波了 一起干起来 结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Affirmative. Time to dig in, work together. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.54,0:56:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是狩猎聚会？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it a hunting party?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.84,0:56:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 这可不是什么小马秀！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure as hell ain't no pony show!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.55,0:56:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 我要把它从这里引开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, look, I'm gonna lead it away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.88,0:56:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始的时候 你们就跑！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I do, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.37,0:56:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.40,0:56:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,像狗看到骨头一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a dog to a bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.50,0:56:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,生物力学是如此迷人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bio-mechanics are so sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.27,0:57:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,去机库！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the hangar!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.68,0:57:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.29,0:57:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,前进！三点钟方向！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming! Three o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.59,0:57:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,靠！不是另一只！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit! Not another one!
