Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.43,0:57:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯瓦克哈莫 快起来！ - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Swackhamer, get up! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.81,0:58:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快！在卡车里！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! In the truck!
