Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.38,0:58:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,它扯住了我的裤子！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing's got me by the pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.32,0:58:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那就脱了你的裤子！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So take off your pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.85,0:58:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我死都不要！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}100% no!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.72,0:58:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 脱了你的裤子 丽塔！ - 不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take off your pants, Rita! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.86,0:58:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快脱了！靠！ - 不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take them off now, goddammit! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.29,0:58:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 我底下什么都没穿！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - I'm not wearing any underwear!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.31,0:58:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你是要去北极突击队吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going commando in the Arctic?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.75,0:58:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我底下什么都没穿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wear underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.18,0:58:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是限制级的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too restricting.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.32,0:58:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想我会喜欢！ - 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think I love! - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.23,0:59:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 哈特 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Hart? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.96,0:59:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天喝了多少能量饮料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many of those energy drinks did you have today?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.24,0:59:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,七罐吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six, maybe seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.04,0:59:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是可能是八罐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, could be eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.44,0:59:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好开跑 温曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get ready to run, Wingman.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.14,0:59:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在执行第二个转移策略{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're executing Diversion Tactic Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.08,0:59:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 哈特 是时候为队里拿个虫头了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Hart. Time to take one for the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.82,0:59:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,脱裤子 让大虫咬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Free Willy and let the big dog eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.53,0:59:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你认真的？你想让我这么做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously? You want me to drop trou?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.53,0:59:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不要质疑我的命令！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't question my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.03,0:59:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 你拿出你的丁丁来甩！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you take out that disco stick, and let it dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.20,0:59:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 不要任何人看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Don't anybody look.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.07,0:59:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄！我们有更大的虫子咬操心了！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude! We have bigger worms to worry about!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.37,0:59:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,准备重新部署！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get ready to redeploy!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.55,0:59:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那是男孩的游戏！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That boy's got game!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.72,0:59:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,准备开火！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire at will!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.89,1:00:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 最好今天！ - 我在努力！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Preferably today! - I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.87,1:00:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 快！如果你要像小狗一样撒尿 就呆在上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on! If you're gonna piss like a puppy, stay on the porch.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.14,1:00:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是小狗 甘莫先生 我会告诉你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm no puppy, Mr. Gummer. I'll tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.38,1:00:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,给我造一个方舟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna build me an ark!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.93,1:00:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很清楚机库在哪儿 走！走！走！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're clear to the hangar. Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.31,1:01:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,坏消息 瓦尔 十一点钟方向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad news, Val. Eleven o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.18,1:01:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这次格拉波虫变成两个了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That makes the Graboid count two.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.61,1:01:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 两个活着 一个死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, two alive. One dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.80,1:02:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,伯特？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burt, you copy? Over?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.37,1:02:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你在吗？请回答？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You there? Copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.27,1:02:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,伯特？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burt?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.54,1:02:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 温曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy, Wingman.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.15,1:02:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.15,1:02:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我能怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the hell wouldn't I be?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.08,1:02:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在打一堆格拉波虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're fighting a Graboid apocalypse
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.38,1:02:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,和一群军士！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a bunch of noncoms!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.15,1:02:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心我！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.52,1:02:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就行任务就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stick to the mission objective.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.47,1:03:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧把这些虫子弄进去！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to get one of those worms pronto!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.29,1:03:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,小心！朝你过去了！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out! It's headed your way!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.36,1:03:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,从钻塔进来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming. From the drill tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.19,1:03:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,祈祷吧 我要打开这个小闸门了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say a prayer, I'm gonna flip the switch on this ittle cucarcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.63,1:03:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,一！二！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One! Two!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.43,1:03:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,三！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.20,1:03:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,靠！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.68,1:03:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.76,1:03:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,它还活着 它还在动！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's working. It's actually working!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.96,1:04:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,它过不来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't get through.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.83,1:04:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说过我可是事半功倍的！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I've done more with less!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.70,1:04:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,快！哇！我的妈！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Whoo! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.64,1:04:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗 伯特？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How're you doing out there, Burt?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.94,1:04:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,讲话啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.48,1:04:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,伯特 你还活着吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burt, you're alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.88,1:04:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,老头子 你一生中从未放弃过任何东西啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've never given up on anything in your life, old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.28,1:04:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,别现在放弃啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't start now!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.42,1:04:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你的父亲状况不容乐观 啊 特拉维斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You father is very sick, Travis.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.26,1:04:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他不能死 至少不是现在 在没有我的注视下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't die. Not now. Not on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.29,1:04:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他第二次神经肌肉崩溃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is his second neuro-muscular collapse.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.27,1:04:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 特拉维斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Travis.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.57,1:04:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,快起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.50,1:04:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 看 我们抓住了其中一个对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, look, we capture one of these things, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.37,1:04:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样得到我们要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we get what we need?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.87,1:04:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,喉咙里应该有一个腺囊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There should be a glandular sac somewhere in the throat.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.98,1:04:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,看来莎莉在测试我们的地下电栅栏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like Sally's testing our underground electrical fence.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.28,1:04:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是莎莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's Sally?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.19,1:04:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你给它取得名字？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You named it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.02,1:05:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个前任的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After an ex.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.22,1:05:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,莎莉 灵魂毁灭者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sally Soulsmasher.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.86,1:05:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,她是一个肮脏的 吃人的婊子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was a dirty, man-eating bitch
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.76,1:05:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经把她的脸贴在不属于她的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who used to stick her nose where it didn't belong.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.53,1:05:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything okay out there?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.67,1:05:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 长官 把门锁上 结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that, sir. Just locking the gate. All clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.04,1:05:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不要动 你这个傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop moving, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.39,1:05:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,它在穿过地板！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's coming through the floor!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.96,1:05:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,温曼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wingman?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.73,1:05:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,温曼 你在吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wingman, you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.13,1:05:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,伯特 你怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burt. How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.33,1:05:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好的很{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fit as a butcher's dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.26,1:06:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我去找你 温曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming your way, Wingman!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.38,1:06:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 伙计们 我们走 去干它一场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, guys. Let's go. Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.55,1:06:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,斯瓦克哈莫 开炸吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swackhamer, start making those bombs.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.49,1:06:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看 伯特 我们… - 灭了这些恶魔！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look, Burt, we... - Got to destroy these devils!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.26,1:06:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 我们的得抓住其中一个！ - 我们不抓了 都杀掉！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, we have to catch one of these! - We don't catch. We kill!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.33,1:06:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 即使它杀了你 - 这不关我的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Even if it kills you? - This is not about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.73,1:06:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是 不关你的事！ - 如果我们拿到格拉波虫就不一样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, it is! - Not if we still got Graboids out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.41,1:06:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,得了 伯特 我只是想了解你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Burt. I'm just getting to know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.97,1:06:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想看到你可怜的死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna see your sorry ass die.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.64,1:07:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,挡我说我死了 我就死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be dead when I say I'm dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.68,1:07:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,然而并不是这样！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not how this works!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.01,1:07:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,据我所知 你不是这里下命令的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last I checked, you don't give the orders around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.52,1:07:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我现在是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I do now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.52,1:07:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来不回答我的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never answered my question.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.75,1:07:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪拿到的HK91{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd you get that HK91?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.23,1:07:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,前妻 伯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ex-wife, Burt.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.86,1:07:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,谁给你权利干涉我的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who gave you the right to meddle in my affairs?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.20,1:07:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿！我是你的某件事的结果 记得吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! I'm the result of one of your affairs, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.80,1:07:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,靠！靠！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit! Bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.24,1:07:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要把我绕进这场谈话！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not hooking and reeling me into this conversation!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.98,1:07:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜我碰到了他的软肋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I touched his thermostat.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.48,1:07:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你想死吗？恩？是不是？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna die? Huh? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.25,1:07:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,别那么固执{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop being so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.19,1:07:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,靠！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.56,1:07:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.63,1:07:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,事史说忽悠吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you say hooking and reeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.87,1:08:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 伯特 你真是个天才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, Burt, you are a genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.17,1:08:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 麦克 我们在飞机上做这个怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mac, how are we doing on that plane?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.37,1:08:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我得在拧几个螺丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've got to put a wrench to a few more screws.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.71,1:08:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.08,1:08:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我有办法抓住这些东西！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I've got a way we can catch one of these things!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.38,1:08:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.09,1:08:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,地震警报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The seismic alarm.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.20,1:08:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为今天的汽车设定了核心样品钻探 记得吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We set the core sample drilling on auto for today, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.78,1:08:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那个该死的钻井塔就想格拉波虫的猫薄荷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That damn drilling tower is like Graboid catnip.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.31,1:08:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那只猫已经上钩了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That puss has already taken the bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.86,1:09:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 如果我们不能把它关掉 我们就得让格拉波虫离开哈特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, if we can't turn it off, we've got to lead that Graboid away from Hart.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.60,1:09:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我得把钻机关掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to shut off the drill rig.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.43,1:09:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能下去瓦尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't go down there, Val.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.12,1:09:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗队形！弄一些噪音！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Battle stations! Let's make some noise!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.09,1:09:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这次把电压加倍 我要他死！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Double the voltage this time. I want him dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.79,1:09:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 哈特 我来了！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Hart. I'm coming!
