Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.09,1:10:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,来爸爸这儿！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to papa!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.98,1:10:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,斯瓦克哈莫！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swackhamer!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.25,1:10:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哇！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.00,1:10:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,断你的路！要你的命！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll close the carpool lane!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.17,1:10:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,闯进了这个错误的机库 不是吗 你这个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Broke into the wrong goddamn hangar, didn't you, you bastard?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.58,1:11:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦尔 就在你前面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Val, it's in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.46,1:11:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧 哈特 撤退！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, Hart. It's retreating!
