Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.10,1:11:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,快！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.90,1:11:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 让我们不要一团糟的庆祝 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's not celebrate in a huddle, folks.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.04,1:11:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,外面只好还有一个格拉波虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've still got at least one Graboid out there.
