Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.29,1:11:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.96,1:11:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没有地下电子围栏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No underground electrical fence.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.27,1:11:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须送他去医院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to get him to medical.
