Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.99,1:12:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有异常吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any movement?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.13,1:12:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. Zip.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.69,1:12:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小人物 - 纳达·木乔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Zilch. - Nada mucho.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.40,1:12:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们跑过去 更快到那 - 行吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I say we run, get there fast. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.46,1:12:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,要是怪物来了 我也无所畏惧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that thing attacks, I'll just honey badger the shit out of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.63,1:12:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊 这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, help? Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.87,1:12:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 他居然活着？我没做错什么 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit, he lived? I've got to do the right thing, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.17,1:12:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good habit to start.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.08,1:12:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 丽塔 你带阿克拉克和伯特去治疗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Rita, you take Aklark and Burt to the medical.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.25,1:12:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你怎么做 保住他们的命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care what you have to do to keep him alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.95,1:12:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,斯瓦克 你跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swackhamer, you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.52,1:12:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,数到三 我们就冲 一、二、三 快冲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On three, we break. One, two, three, break!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.99,1:12:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,能见到你们真开心 快把我弄下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, am I glad to see you guys now! Get me down from here.
