Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.14,1:13:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,胆小鬼 要是你还有一丢丢的胆量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, candy-ass! If you have a set of balls,
