Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.89,1:14:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,怪物在那 我们可以狂轰滥炸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There she blows. Time for some psy ops.
