Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.56,1:15:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伯特 别紧张 - 不要对我说别紧张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take it easy, Burt. - Don't tell me to take it easy.
