Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.03,1:15:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁说听你的了 - 你说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who put you in charge? - You did.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.96,1:15:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我说的？ - 是啊 你受伤时说的伯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I did? - Yeah, once you got hurt, Burt.
