Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.00,1:15:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你站不住的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't stand, Colonel Custer!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.44,1:15:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回去吧 - 他不属于你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Back off! - It doesn't belong to you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.34,1:15:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,寒冷 残肢 是这些吗 伯特？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cold, dead hands, is that it, Burt?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.48,1:15:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is wrong with you?
