Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.45,1:16:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你越界了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've crossed the line!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.19,1:16:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,与你的战斗已经完结{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This fight is done with you.
