Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.26,1:16:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你已经结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.20,1:16:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不要让我手无寸铁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave me unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.51,1:16:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.58,1:16:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你有了真整坚实的靠山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got your true love back.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.12,1:16:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我想血液肯定不比弹药厚 对吧 伯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess blood ain't thicker than ammo, is it, Burt?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.86,1:16:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.69,1:17:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你菊花能放炮 你就能战胜格拉波虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you've got Ass Blasters, you have Graboids.
