Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.40,1:17:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,TMZ{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TMZ.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.47,1:17:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胆量足够进吉尼斯纪录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My balls are in the Guinness Book of Balls!
